  "implementationNotes": [
    "Node hooks run in Worker isolates in the same OS process; at most four workers/external commands are active.",
    "Per-hook deadlines include time spent in the dispatch queue; timeout results pass and discard partial output.",
    "The runtime manifest preserves custom synchronous hooks; asynchronous hooks remain individually registered.",
    "Unknown external hooks are retained during load shedding to avoid dropping potential deny gates.",
    "A credential-refresh retry may invoke the existing provisioner git helper; gate evaluation itself does not start another Node process.",
    "Measurements are on Linux/WSL, not a Windows conhost/taskkill measurement. The PowerShell concurrency test uses a local pwsh protocol fixture.",
    "node --test tools/ is not supported by this Node version; the final run uses the same discovery command as CI.",
    "Test fixtures that copy setup.mjs include its new registry dependency. Interrupted PowerShell fixture directory was removed from the validation clone before the final full run."
  ],
